{"id": "t057-001", "text": "Kasia's birthday is next Tuesday. She mentioned she's been getting into pottery, so a voucher for a wheel class would probably go down well.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "voucher for a wheel class would probably go down well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t057-002", "text": "Lunch with Obi today. He starts at the new firm on Monday and is a bit nervous about the commute. Remind me to text him Monday evening to see how the first day went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Obi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts at the new firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit nervous about the commute", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t057-003", "text": "Vanessa and Luca are having a housewarming on Saturday from 7pm. They've finally moved into the place on Elm Road after months of the sale falling through. Luca's mum will be there, and Vanessa warned me she asks everyone about their love life. Apparently they still have no sofa, so it's a bring-a-cushion situation. I'm getting the train, so leave by 6.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday from 7pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved into the place on Elm Road", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "asks everyone about their love life", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "leave", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 6", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t057-004", "text": "Anders told me he's retiring at the end of next month after 32 years at the council. His wife is planning a surprise do for him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "32 years at the council", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t057-005", "text": "Dentist moved to Thursday at 10:15. Need to pick up the dry cleaning on the way back.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Dentist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 10:15", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pick up the dry cleaning", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the way back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t057-006", "text": "Noor got the promotion! She's now head of operations. I should send her flowers this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "head of operations", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t057-007", "text": "Mehmet's dinner party on Friday is off, his daughter has chickenpox. He said we'll rearrange once she's better.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chickenpox", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "once she's better", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t057-008", "text": "Chioma loves anything to do with Studio Ghibli. Her favourite is Kiki's Delivery Service.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Studio Ghibli", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Kiki's Delivery Service", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t057-009", "text": "Call with Tunde this morning. His last day at the bank is a week on Friday and the leaving drinks are at the Crown afterwards, from about half 5. Don't forget to chip in for the card and present, Gemma is collecting.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day at the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week on Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "from about half 5", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in for the card and present", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t057-010", "text": "Esme is having a really rough time at the new job. Her manager keeps piling things on and she's not sleeping much. She said she's thinking of quitting before Christmas but is worried about money, since her partner Obi is between contracts too. Should check in with her over the weekend, maybe suggest a walk on Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rough time at the new job", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sleeping much", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quitting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about money", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Obi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "between contracts", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "suggest a walk", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t057-011", "text": "Ayo's son Kofi turns six on Sunday. Dinosaurs are still the big thing, apparently.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kofi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns six", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Dinosaurs", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t057-012", "text": "I'm bringing dessert to Adriana's on Saturday night. Probably a tiramisu.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adriana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday night"}]}
{"id": "t057-013", "text": "Remind me to ask Karan how the interview went on Wednesday. It was for the product manager role at Wang & Partners.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Karan how the interview went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t057-014", "text": "Zofia's mum is turning seventy in a fortnight and the whole family is going to Kraków for the weekend to celebrate. Zofia is in charge of the cake and is stressing about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning seventy", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Kraków", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t057-015", "text": "Bumped into Lachlan at the station. He's been made redundant, they're closing the Leeds office. He seemed fairly upbeat about it but I'd like to take him for a pint soon. He's got a payout coming and is talking about using some of it to finally do the West Highland Way in the spring. His kids are both at uni now so he says the timing is oddly good.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lachlan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fairly upbeat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a pint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "West Highland Way", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "at uni", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t057-016", "text": "Sam (Samantha, not Sam from football) has a dog called Biscuit who is turning one tomorrow. She's throwing it a party, genuinely.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samantha", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog called Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning one", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t057-017", "text": "Emil and his partner Mia are hosting a games night on the 14th at 8. I said I'd come.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "games night", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th at 8", "anchor": "e1"}]}
