{"id": "t057-032", "text": "Don't forget Uncle Vikram's sixtieth on Saturday. Mum wants us there by 2.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Vikram", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "sixtieth", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 2", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t057-033", "text": "Mateo had his first week as a junior chef. He says the head chef shouts a lot but he's learning loads. He looked exhausted.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mateo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first week as a junior chef", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "head chef", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "shouts a lot", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t057-034", "text": "Luca's partner Adriana is turning forty on the 3rd. Luca wants to do a surprise dinner at that Italian place on Tuesday the 2nd and asked if I can keep the evening free. I said yes. He's also asked me to sort the cake, which I'm doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adriana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning forty", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise dinner", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday the 2nd", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t057-035", "text": "Mia is starting her PhD in October and moving to Glasgow. Her girlfriend is staying in Bristol for now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "staying in Bristol", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "t057-036", "text": "Should ring Grandma on Sunday afternoon, it's been ages.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Grandma", "owner": "r1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Grandma"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t057-037", "text": "Obi's wife Kasia had her baby on Tuesday morning! A little boy, Tobi. Remind me to send something, maybe a babygrow and a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Obi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tobi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t057-038", "text": "Gemma Brennan from work is leaving on Friday after eight years. There's a collection going round. She loves gardening and has been talking about getting a greenhouse. Her husband is retiring at the same time, and they're moving to Cornwall in the new year to be nearer their grandkids. I'll put in twenty quid and write something in the card on Thursday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma Brennan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "gardening", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "talking about getting a greenhouse", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same time", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Cornwall", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandkids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday"}]}
{"id": "t057-039", "text": "Lachlan told me he's been offered a promotion to team lead but isn't sure he wants it. He has to decide by next Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lachlan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion to team lead", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't sure he wants it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by next Wednesday"}]}
{"id": "t057-040", "text": "Anders' granddaughter has her christening on Sunday the 9th at 11am. He's thrilled.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "granddaughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday the 9th at 11am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
