{"id": "t057-044", "text": "Karan and Noor are throwing a joint thirtieth on Saturday the 18th, starting at 8. Dress code is 'something gold'. I need to find something gold.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joint thirtieth", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday the 18th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "starting at 8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find something gold", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t057-045", "text": "Talked to Connor after the match. His mum retires next month and he's trying to plan a party but his sisters can't agree on anything. He's a bit frazzled. One sister wants a quiet meal, the other wants a marquee in the garden with a band. Their mum just wants a new set of golf clubs, by the sound of it. Connor asked if I'd be up for helping with invitations next weekend, which I'm happy to do.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the match"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retires", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sisters", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit frazzled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a new set of golf clubs", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next weekend"}]}
