{"id": "t057-051", "text": "Sam's engagement party is next Saturday at the cricket club. Her fiancé Dawit is from Addis, so his family are flying in on Thursday. She asked if I could help set up from 4. I need to remember to bring the fairy lights and the extension lead. Also find out whether Dawit's parents speak much English, so I can at least learn hello in Amharic before Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fiancé", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Addis", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "from 4", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring the fairy lights and the extension lead", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find out whether Dawit's parents speak much English", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Saturday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
