{"id": "t057-056", "text": "Anika got into the choir she auditioned for. Rehearsals start next Tuesday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the choir", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Rehearsals", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday evening", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t057-057", "text": "Note to self: Mateo's birthday is the 27th, not the 29th. He's really into climbing so maybe a chalk bag or a day pass at the bouldering place.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mateo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 27th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 29th"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "climbing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "chalk bag or a day pass at the bouldering place", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t057-058", "text": "Long chat with Esme tonight. Her brother Lachlan has been offered a job in Toronto and is flying out in a fortnight for a final interview. Their dad isn't well, so Esme is worried about him being so far away. She's also hosting Sunday lunch for the family this weekend and asked if I could come at 12 to help with the cooking. I should bring wine and maybe a pudding.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lachlan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job in Toronto", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "final interview", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't well", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Sunday lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "12", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring wine and maybe a pudding", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}]}
{"id": "t057-059", "text": "Nasser's retirement party is on Friday at 6 in the function room above the Red Lion. His daughter Zofia is giving a speech and is really nervous about it. Remind me to text Zofia on Thursday night to wish her luck.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retirement party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 6", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Zofia", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t057-060", "text": "Quiet weekend planned. Going to finally sort the spare room and maybe do a long walk on Sunday morning.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday morning"}]}
